#: src/Abilities/ChangeDeliveryAddress.php:67
msgid "Changes the shipping address of an order with personalised lines and sends it to the printshop for each line already ordered, as saving the order on its screen does. Only the fields given change; with none, a change the printshop never answered is sent again. Each line's `delivery` then says where the change stands."
