msgid "The order has no personalised line whose printshop order can take a new address: none is ordered yet, or each is finished, being cancelled or erased. A line not yet ordered is placed with the address the order has then; change it with the order itself."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/ChangeDeliveryAddress.php:160
msgid "The new address was saved on the order, but it could not be scheduled for the printshop. Save the order on its screen, or run this again, to send it."
msgstr ""

