#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/MoveProductTemplate.php:51
msgid "Move a product to another template version"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/MoveProductTemplate.php:52
msgid "Moves every side of a personalised simple or variable product on a template, and of each of its personalised variations with a setup of its own, to another version of the template or to another template, keeping each side's placement, print sizes, start size, form arrangement and mode. Pixonaut checks each again; one that fails a check is saved but cannot be bought, and the answer says why."
msgstr ""

